  captionObject: {fileID: 1459373059}
  captionTextObject: {fileID: 385503030}
  speakerTextObject: {fileID: 1328007084}
  captions:
  - The woman sleeping in this bed keeps seeing these three figures in her dreams.
  - They seem familiar, but she doesn't know why.\nYou need to help her remember.
  - Remember the name of the green one.\nRemember the voice of the blue one.\nRemember
    the face of the gold one.
  - 'Her memories are tied to them in three objects: a diary, a radio, and a collection
    of photographs. You must use these memory vessels together to help her.'
  - 'A word to the wise: start with the photographs.\n\nClick to begin.'
  speakers:
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
